{"name": "Sublight", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/9e942d42989b0df8416cfdfe62448eac.poster.avif?t=1787395499\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/9e942d42989b0df8416cfdfe62448eac.webm?t=1787395499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/9e942d42989b0df8416cfdfe62448eac.mp4?t=1787395499\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><u><strong>SURVIVE A HOSTILE GALAXY</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command a stellar battleship and fight through multiple deadly sectors filled with relentless foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip turrets, stack upgrades, and face everything from rogue rebel fleets to ravenous alien swarms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/d139fc7dfe2d98a8c2777c27bfc55645.poster.avif?t=1787395499\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/d139fc7dfe2d98a8c2777c27bfc55645.webm?t=1787395499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/d139fc7dfe2d98a8c2777c27bfc55645.mp4?t=1787395499\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>DISCOVER A POWERFUL ARSENAL</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast enemies to salvage materials and level up your ship. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a vast pool of turrets: shredding autocannons, piercing railguns, and more. Combine them with dozens of passive upgrades to fine-tune every detail of your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The tools of destruction are yours to assemble\u2026 just mind your firing arcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/7c04f389d765d49d3773c2d8432ef260.poster.avif?t=1787395499\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/7c04f389d765d49d3773c2d8432ef260.webm?t=1787395499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/7c04f389d765d49d3773c2d8432ef260.mp4?t=1787395499\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>UNLOCK NEW WAYS TO DOMINATE THE STARS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a variety of unique ships, each with multiple alternative loadouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every hull comes with integrated weapon systems and abilities that transform your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete in-game challenges to earn even more ships, weapons, and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/3d0eeb6196b4f7e0cb3e076bc93eb1dc.poster.avif?t=1787395499\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/3d0eeb6196b4f7e0cb3e076bc93eb1dc.webm?t=1787395499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/extras/3d0eeb6196b4f7e0cb3e076bc93eb1dc.mp4?t=1787395499\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Sublight is a space bullet heaven roguelike, where you captain a powerful warship and carve through escalating waves of enemies. Upgrade your arsenal, unlock new ships, and experiment with countless builds to dominate the battlefield.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829310/82e536a56a89664d941a977cb5d7304bf25946f5/header.jpg?t=1787395499", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Bullet Hell", "Roguelite", "Arcade", "3D", "Top-Down"], "developers": "CODEBREW SOFTWARE LTD", "publishers": "CODEBREW SOFTWARE LTD", "release_date": "Sep 15, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3829310", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "27 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/0URhTyaJR3g", "first_seen": 1774566000.0, "review_rank": 943}